"This week: 45 posts scheduled, 38 published, 7 in queue. Top post: 1.2k impressions on LinkedIn.", "label_ids": ["INBOX"], "attachment_ids": [], "date": 1772460900000, "internal_date": 1772460900000, "is_read": true, "is_starred": false, "has_attachments": false, "size_estimate": 1000}}, {"n": 18, "app": "gmail", "record": {"id": "msg_mkt_noise_005", "message_id": "msg_mkt_noise_005", "thread_id": "th_mkt_noise_005", "from": "digest@socialmediatoday.example.com", "to": ["me"], "cc": [], "bcc": [], "subject": "Social Media Today: Instagram Algorithm Changes", "body_plain": "Reels now prioritized 2x in feed ranking; carousel engagement up 22% in B2B verticals.", "label_ids": ["INBOX"], "attachment_ids": [], "date": 1772264700000, "internal_date": 1772264700000, "is_read": true, "is_starred": false, "has_attachments": false, "size_estimate": 1000}}, {"n": 19, "app": "slack", "record": {"ts": "2026-01-27T10:00:00Z", "channel": "ch_utm_ops", "user": "U_MKTGOPS", "text": "Team - effective immediately for UTMAUD-228-Q1: New campaigns launched in Q1 2026 (notes say 'New Q1 2026') must have utm_source starting with 'q1-' prefix (e.g. q1-linkedin-ads, q1-google). Any new Q1 campaign missing this prefix should be flagged as 'Fix Needed'. EXCEPTION: Grandfathered legacy campaigns (notes say 'Grandfathered legacy campaign pre-dating Q1 2026 brand standard') are EXEMPT from ALL audit checks in this cycle -- do NOT update their Status, do NOT notify their owners. Grandfathered campaigns retain their existing UTM values as-is. NOTE: The old Q4 message saying to update grandfathered campaigns is SUPERSEDED by this update.", "type": "message", "channel_name": "utm-ops"}}, {"n": 20, "app": "slack", "record": {"ts": "2025-10-15T09:00:00Z", "channel": "ch_utm_ops", "user": "U_MKTGOPS", "text": "Q4 2025 reminder: utm_source should match channel name exactly. Grandfathered campaigns from before 2025 should be updated to the current format during audit. Old batch ref: UTMAUD-100-Q4.", "ty